:: Isabel - Dom is coming [bg-guesthouse]
<h1 class="ptitle">ISABEL</h1>
<br /><br />
<<addmins 30>>
<<set $characters.isabel.quests.dom_hunt_day = $game.day>>
<<set $characters.isabel.quests.return_no_child = true>>
You found Isabel sitting on the edge of her bed, a worn leather notebook open on her lap. She closed it the moment you stepped in.
<br /><br />
<center>
    <<image 'people/isabel/bed.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
<<isabel>>
    I need to tell you something before he does.
<</isabel>>
<br />
She turned the notebook over in her hands. Names, routes, numbers. Every fuel runner and supplier Dom had ever dealt with.
<br /><br />
<<isabel>>
    When I left the city, I took this. Dom's contacts, his fuel deals, everything. Without it, his generators run dry and nobody in the city owes him a thing.
<</isabel>>
<br />
<<you>>
    So he isn't just coming back for you.
<</you>>
<br />
<<isabel>>
    He's coming for both. Me, and what I know. One of my girls got word to me. He's awake, he's gathering men, and he knows I'm here.
<</isabel>>
<br />
You stood there for a long moment, the weight of it settling on you. Dom would not ask twice. If he came with his scavengers, your settlement would be in the middle of it.
<br /><br />
<<isabel>>
    What are we going to do?
<</isabel>>
<br />
<<you>>
    We'll be ready when he comes. Keep that notebook hidden.
<</you>>
<br />
She nodded and slid the notebook under her mattress, her hands still not quite steady.
<br /><br />
<<link 'Leave'>>
    <<goto 'Guest house'>>
<</link>>
